flowchart LR
  Event["Trigger / Event"] --> Init["Initialize run + context"]
  Init --> Observe["Observe"]
  Observe --> Decide["Plan / Decide"]
  Decide --> Call["Authorize and execute tool"]
  Call --> Check{"Validated and complete?"}
  Check -->|No, within limits| Observe
  Check -->|Yes| Save["Save result and state"]
  Check -->|Blocked / exhausted| Escalate["Escalate or fail safely"]
  Save --> End["Terminal run state"]
  Escalate --> End
